# INVWINKB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the code lists.
# Items > Categories shows the categories in their order, code, name and
# order number, the first selected, and F1 their help (CATS); New adds
# MISC, the list fetched again with it selected; Edit renames it and
# moves it first by its order number; Delete on SYS, which an item has,
# is refused in a message box, the list unchanged; Delete on MISC asks
# first, No keeping it, then Yes; E alone opens nothing, F5 fetches the
# list again on the row selected; Close ends the list.  Locations >
# Location types shows the types; New shows its form and adds CRATE; Del
# on ROOM, which a location has, is refused; CTRL+E shows SHELF's form
# and renames it Shelving, and the tree opened next shows the new name;
# Location types over the tree, Ins opening New, which Esc leaves,
# renames it Shelf again, the tree showing it at once; over Office's
# contents it renames it Shelving, and Esc from the contents shows the
# tree with that name; Type's pick list in the location form lists Crate.
# At level 1 (READER) the list shows with New, Edit and Delete disabled,
# and Ins, CTRL+E and Del on it open nothing; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINKB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I C
S CATS
K F1
S CHELP
K ESC ALT-N
S NEW
T MISC
K TAB
T Odds and ends
K TAB
T 60
K ENTER
S ADDED
K ALT-E
S EDIT
T Miscellany
K TAB
T 1
K ENTER
S RENAMED
K HOME
T S
S ONSYS
K ALT-D
S ASKSYS
K Y
S INUSE
K ENTER
S STILL
K HOME ALT-D
S ASKMISC
K N
S KEPTMISC
K ALT-D Y
S DELETED
K DOWN E
S PLAINE
K F5
S REFRESH
K ESC
S CLOSED
K ALT-L T
S LTYPES
K ALT-N
S LTNEW
T CRATE
K TAB
T Crate
K ENTER
S CRATE
K HOME DEL Y
S ROOMUSED
K ENTER
T S
K CTRL-E
S LTEDIT
T Shelving
K ENTER
S SHELVING
K ESC ALT-L B
S TREE
K ALT-L T
T S
K INS ESC ALT-E
T Shelf
K ENTER ESC
S RESHELF
K HOME ENTER ALT-L T
T S
